msgid "Throughout this page, $p$ is a precision in bits, $\\circ(x)$ is the rounding of the real number $x$ under the active context, and \"the flags\" are the five IEEE exception flags of a `BinaryFlags` value. `@lf_arith` is the `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` package; its `RoundingMode`, `ArithmeticContext` and `ArithmeticError` types appear in several signatures (the interface file prints the package as `@arithmetic`)."
msgstr ""

