msgstr ""

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:293
msgid "These methods compare all stored components (text or name and span). Use `==` and `!=` in new code."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:305
msgid "Two literals with the same text but different spans are different."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:309
