#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:13
msgid "Mandatory operation vectors use exact integer/rational construction and the documented DPD/BID bridge. Elementary families use independent high-precision or interval oracles when available. Values or encoded bits and IEEE flags are recorded independently so a numerically plausible result cannot hide a flag error."
