#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:198
msgid "Generic code with the enclosure relations"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:200
msgid "`BallFloat` implements the enclosure relations of Luna-Flow/arithmetic (`Contains`, `DefinitelyLt`, …). Extract the interval at the end of a pipeline and test it:"
