msgid "[decimal API](../api/decimal.md): every type and function with its exact semantics."
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:314
msgid "[decimal design](../design/decimal.md): formats, cohorts, encodings, rounding, error bounds and certification."
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:316
msgid "[decimal conformance](../conformance/decimal.md) and [decimal performance](../performance/decimal.md): the finite evidence and the measurement method."
msgstr ""

