#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:3
msgid "This page is for maintainers of the numeric cores. It shows how the helpers of `internal` are combined: rounding a decimal coefficient to a precision, parsing a decimal literal into exact parts, and writing a refinement loop that certifies a rounded result. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`; the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled against the published package."
