#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:166
msgid "**`round_shift` with $s \\le 0$** returns the input unchanged; it never shifts left."
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:168
msgid "**Zero loses its exponent.** `remove_factor2`, `remove_factor10` and `trim_trailing_decimal_zeros` return exponent 0 for a zero coefficient. Keep the original exponent yourself if the cohort of zero matters."
msgstr ""

